{"name": "b480-S7-p", "sha256": "606ace335a1328be7af3682efa6bb5118757570aec38d75b2b669f73ca76fa09", "words": 80, "headline": "Human Written", "prediction_short": "Human", "fraction_ai": 2.5643761897144152e-43, "fraction_ai_assisted": 0.0, "fraction_human": 1.0, "version": "4.1", "source": "new", "dashboard_link": "https://www.pangram.com/history/52b86d77-b680-4366-a544-3854ae540784", "utc": "2026-10-26T01:17:43Z", "windows": [["Human Written", "High", 84, 0, 442, "Here I’m going to talk about what you develop in yourself as you reparent your inner child. I’m going to talk about it in terms of three jobs: your loving Nurturer, your safe Adult Protector (hereafter just the Protector) and your wise Guide. It’s one person doing three jobs rather than getting three more people to move in with you to help with the rent! Each job keeps the others in balance. It’s you that needs to develop these qualities."]]}
{"name": "b480-S8-p+next", "sha256": "35e28a0c0841673caecf1989a83322c5a1766be1b0efcfc619cc187871da5d7f", "words": 185, "headline": "Human Written", "prediction_short": "Human", "fraction_ai": 7.807651552192707e-13, "fraction_ai_assisted": 8.021536428826901e-37, "fraction_human": 1.0, "version": "4.1", "source": "new", "dashboard_link": "https://www.pangram.com/history/8cc85c99-3638-4495-ac87-ca83d725c67c", "utc": "2026-10-26T01:17:47Z", "windows": [["Human Written", "High", 38, 0, 216, "Instead, you might feel numb, cynical, angry, hungry, like you need to look at your phone, sexually aroused, like you need to make plans, sleepy, dissociated, or you might even think that what you're doing is stupid."], ["Human Written", "Medium", 13, 216, 295, " Those are not failures. Often they are you experiencing a very charming guard."], ["Human Written", "High", 97, 295, 793, " It's what protects you when your consciously installed parental Protector isn't functioning, the same as when you were a child. Before figuring out what/where it is, make sure to ask what it is trying to stop or what it wants. It may, of course, be your inner child, mad that it’s taken you so long to come back, or it may be your inherited parent script, or something from earlier in the day, or a combination.\n(To the guard, in the same Nurturer voice you meant for your inner child: “I see you."], ["Human Written", "Medium", 10, 793, 833, " I'm not going to force my way past you."], ["Human Written", "High", 35, 833, 1021, " What's going on?” Then wait and listen patiently. If nothing comes, that's fine for now. At some point you can ask, “What are you afraid would happen if you stopped protecting me by…..?”)"]]}
{"name": "b480-S9-p", "sha256": "f8ec9f8ba76addb6f95861b6af8a8d23d2109d9702f9c4996100f9ccbed95e1c", "words": 127, "headline": "AI Detected", "prediction_short": "Mixed", "fraction_ai": 0.41250303387641907, "fraction_ai_assisted": 0.0, "fraction_human": 0.5874969959259033, "version": "4.1", "source": "new", "dashboard_link": "https://www.pangram.com/history/0998d046-5087-4d3c-8ca0-388a19abca28", "utc": "2026-10-26T01:17:51Z", "windows": [["Human Written", "High", 73, 0, 403, "One important thing to become aware of when approaching your inner child is your inherited parent script. Your parent script is made up of a collection of rules and ways of treating yourself that you adopted as a child (mostly based on how you were treated by your parent(s)). It doesn’t always take the form of a voice. It is not the inner adult (Nurturer, Protector, Guide) that you consciously build."], ["AI-Generated", "Low", 30, 403, 560, " Often this script acts as a critic or warden, telling your inner child not to cry, not to be “needy”, not to embarrass them, not to be too independent, etc."], ["AI-Generated", "Medium", 27, 560, 686, " So when you begin talking to your child in a new, loving way, the script may jump in to say that what you’re doing is “fake”."]]}
